er users are  here to guide  deku on this journey nana then  apologizes for testing deku with such a  difficult question  but both she and the first user are very  happy that deku was the one who became  their successor  nana regrets that she and gran torino  abandoned shigaraki's father in order to  focus on fighting all for one  but she is now pinning all of her hopes  on  deku she hopes that deku can find a way  to rescue that little crying boy her  grandson  from the clutches of all for one on the  final page of this chapter  the first one for all user turns to the  other two users the second user  and the third user those are the two  guys who are just standing in the  background and facing the wall  the first one for all user tells them to  chime in  and tell deku what to expect from their  quirks and that is how this  chapter ends man horikoshi has really  piqued my curiosity about these two  mysterious  former users who were they and why are  they going out of their way to hide  their faces from  deku and what information are they about  to reveal i've heard some crazy theories  about these two  like the theory that the guy whose hair  looks like bakugou's is actually bakugo  from the future who somehow traveled to  the past  but i really don't know what to think  did these guys do something bad  during their lives and they are hiding  because they're ashamed  or do they have extremely powerful  quirks which are difficult to master  and so they are hiding from deku until  he is strong enough to handle their  quirks because maybe if he manifests  them too early  they could actually hurt him definitely  let me know what you guys think about  these two users down  in the comments why are they hiding and  what kind of quirks do you think they  possess  now i want to talk a bit about this  whole deku trying to save shigaraki  thing  i think that deku might be making a huge  mistake by trying to save shigaraki  instead of killing him yes it's true  that shigaraki 